{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49082","headline":"摊破浣溪沙 二 · 南唐嗣主李璟","name":"摊破浣溪沙 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"手卷真珠上玉钩，依前春恨锁重楼。\n风里落花谁是主，思悠悠。\n青鸟不传云外信，丁香空结雨中愁。\n回首渌波三峡暮，接天流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"南唐嗣主李璟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}